  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Bosnia and Herzegovina climate action through development of NDC 3.0 and operationalization of the environmental information system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects primary goal is to strengthen BiH&#x2019;s climate governance strategic framework, making it more capable of achieving ambitious adaptation and mitigation targets. The objectives include:1.	Operationalizing the Conceptual Framework for Monitoring and Evaluation of Climate Change Adaptation Indicators, which is a part of the EIS, to ensure effective and comprehensive collection and management of environmental and climate data, including loss &amp; damage data; and2.	Updating the NDC to include</narrative>
  </description>
